# Binary artefacts must never get line-ending conversion. Without this, git on
# Windows rewrites LF to CRLF inside the PDFs on checkout and the files stop
# opening. The commit that added work/outputs/*.pdf raised exactly that warning.
*.pdf binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary

# Notebooks are JSON: keep them LF so a checkout on another platform does not
# rewrite every line and produce a whole-file diff.
*.ipynb text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
